  <item>
    <title>E12｜25年蜕皮，26年重生，恭喜本台成功“孵化”一枚女博士！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e08374b977fb2c47166bb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e08374b977fb2c47166bb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 16 Apr 2026 06:49:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>时隔大半年，失踪人口游野及小扣同学终于重新出现啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目，我们回来了！首先要向各位汇报：过去这段时间，我和小扣为什么“消失”了这么久。我们聊了聊2025年各自打的一场“硬仗”和面临的人生十字路口——这些经历如何重塑了我们对成长、职业和生活的理解。同时，我们也为2026年立下了具体的Flag：发论文、认识自我、专注成长、打理财务…</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听，这是我们交出的一份年度“答卷”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近我和小扣同学都很忙碌，也很久没有deep talk了，无意之间聊了这么久。为方便大家收听，已附上时间轴，可按需跳转收听~</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴奉上⏰：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="142">02:22</a> 入职三年终于申博成功！！咬定青山不放松啊兄弟们！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="344">05:44</a> 接受不完美，灵魂才能更轻盈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="581">09:41</a> 2025年学着面对自我阴暗面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 成绩和痛苦从不分大小，拒绝“量化”个人情绪及价值！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1028">17:08</a> 爱是动词，是课题，也是修炼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 怎么上了班还要写论文啊...</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1491">24:51</a> 被焦虑怪绑架的我，选择就地摊尸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1713">28:33</a> 美伊冲突商业航天大宗商品...神仙天上打架小鬼信息过载</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 资本市场请收下我这“这三瓜俩枣”的学费</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2164">36:04</a> 进入投资世界快换上你的专属皮肤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 委内瑞拉超前消费取向为我们拉响警钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3032">50:32</a> 98年和99年小阿姨终于迎来了自己的“年龄焦虑”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3623">01:00:23</a> 接受世事无常，大肠包小肠呗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4061">01:07:41</a> 望周知：独立女性不是海马体！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4586">01:16:26</a> 从两代女性婚姻观窥见女性自我意识觉醒程度</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目录制于3月18日，剪完发出，已是一个月后。录制结束，我和小扣便又转身投入各自的忙碌。剪辑时不免感慨，时间过得真快。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生不过三万天，越往前走，我越渴望记录下这些平凡的日常——无论以何种形式。我总害怕，多年后回顾一生，若只看到一片空白，定会感到懊悔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>所以，请尽情记录吧。每一次记录，都是我们存在过的可爱证据。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人间游历，务必留痕。;)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643ce97127a8278ac76f59b3/ltKSySzmTYSz-KzA_2zrxtg6ThMS.m4a" length="79362157" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:21:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlwlQx50qgmK3VZ_tE4lZKUjN1H4.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>E11｜分手、离婚、老娘独美去巴黎...2026年朝着5w粉丝迈进！（2025年终总结withNora</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/693ab79637f52a644e69420b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">693ab79637f52a644e69420b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Dec 2025 12:32:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello呀~ 各位听众小宝💞</span></p><span></span><p><span>请查收一份热乎的2025年终总结💌📮！</span></p><span></span><p><span>去年2024年和Nora做了一期年终总结节目，今年梅开二度，再次邀请到Nora录制⏩2025年年终总结。希望争取将此作为每一年度的“保留节目”，记录我们俩每一年的成长与反思。本期闲聊漫谈了许多内容，希望大家听一乐呵嘿嘿嘿~</span></p><span></span><p><span>⏰时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> 情绪崩溃与自我疗愈：建议在宏观与微观之间来回反复横跳。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="492">08:12</a> 世界游民与身份认知。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 在旅行中感受自我生长。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1288">21:28</a> 独自旅行：遇见更加勇敢无畏的自己。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1763">29:23</a> 与父母和解：感谢代际之间的相互理解和包容。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2267">37:47</a> 个人成长与自我对话的力量。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3659">01:00:59</a> 2025年治愈时刻：从“雨果的诗”到“被稳稳接住”。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4065">01:07:45</a> 2025年度好物分享：冥想与墨水屏阅读器。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4494">01:14:54</a> </span><strong><span>⭐在此庄重立下2026年flag</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>Nora：小红书账号粉丝从1w冲向5w💪！</span></p><span></span><p><span>游野：成为瑜伽普拉提执教教练+小红书账号达成5k粉丝小目标💪！</span></p><span></span><p><span>👏本期金句：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>在宏观与微观之间来回切换视角，为了让自己开心，想想办法呗。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“少走弯路”是成长道路上最大的“骗局”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“正面也同意，反面也理解”的中立人格不宜取，做人可以“平衡”，但不能“中立”。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>“无意走神”和“故意走神”还是有很大区别的。</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>🍃雨果的诗</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Demain, dès l'aube（ </span><a href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E3%80%8A%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8%E3%80%8B&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiLjgIrmmI7ml6XmuIXmmajjgIsiLCJ6aGlkYV9zb3VyY2UiOiJlbnRpdHkiLCJjb250ZW50X2lkIjoxMDI0MTgzMDgsImNvbnRlbnRfdHlwZSI6IkFydGljbGUiLCJtYXRjaF9vcmRlciI6MSwiemRfdG9rZW4iOm51bGx9.n-Kd2GcI9JRwb_h35ZBitVX5u6DmWa2mdlGQA1Jtu9E&amp;zhida_source=entity" data-url="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E3%80%8A%E6%98%8E%E6%97%A5%E6%B8%85%E6%99%A8%E3%80%8B&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiLjgIrmmI7ml6XmuIXmmajjgIsiLCJ6aGlkYV9zb3VyY2UiOiJlbnRpdHkiLCJjb250ZW50X2lkIjoxMDI0MTgzMDgsImNvbnRlbnRfdHlwZSI6IkFydGljbGUiLCJtYXRjaF9vcmRlciI6MSwiemRfdG9rZW4iOm51bGx9.n-Kd2GcI9JRwb_h35ZBitVX5u6DmWa2mdlGQA1Jtu9E&amp;zhida_source=entity"><span>《明日清晨》</span></a><span>）是雨果于1847年写成的一首小诗，收录在1856年发表的</span><a href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E3%80%8A%E9%9D%99%E8%A7%82%E9%9B%86%E3%80%8B&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiLjgIrpnZnop4Lpm4bjgIsiLCJ6aGlkYV9zb3VyY2UiOiJlbnRpdHkiLCJjb250ZW50X2lkIjoxMDI0MTgzMDgsImNvbnRlbnRfdHlwZSI6IkFydGljbGUiLCJtYXRjaF9vcmRlciI6MSwiemRfdG9rZW4iOm51bGx9.OaEt7PnWxp94iCw1QLtcVdVJ1DH6MT5Qe6Xro2iatBk&amp;zhida_source=entity" data-url="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=%E3%80%8A%E9%9D%99%E8%A7%82%E9%9B%86%E3%80%8B&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiLjgIrpnZnop4Lpm4bjgIsiLCJ6aGlkYV9zb3VyY2UiOiJlbnRpdHkiLCJjb250ZW50X2lkIjoxMDI0MTgzMDgsImNvbnRlbnRfdHlwZSI6IkFydGljbGUiLCJtYXRjaF9vcmRlciI6MSwiemRfdG9rZW4iOm51bGx9.OaEt7PnWxp94iCw1QLtcVdVJ1DH6MT5Qe6Xro2iatBk&amp;zhida_source=entity"><span>《静观集》</span></a><span>（Les Contemplations）中。1843年，雨果年仅19岁的长女</span><a href="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=L%C3%A9opoldine&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiJMw6lvcG9sZGluZSIsInpoaWRhX3NvdXJjZSI6ImVudGl0eSIsImNvbnRlbnRfaWQiOjEwMjQxODMwOCwiY29udGVudF90eXBlIjoiQXJ0aWNsZSIsIm1hdGNoX29yZGVyIjoxLCJ6ZF90b2tlbiI6bnVsbH0.CipVjiKAkoBXArr_shM-v50VNMnxKye3UC4DJ8ul0n8&amp;zhida_source=entity" data-url="https://zhida.zhihu.com/search?content_id=102418308&amp;content_type=Article&amp;match_order=1&amp;q=L%C3%A9opoldine&amp;zd_token=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpc3MiOiJ6aGlkYV9zZXJ2ZXIiLCJleHAiOjE3NjU2MjgwMDEsInEiOiJMw6lvcG9sZGluZSIsInpoaWRhX3NvdXJjZSI6ImVudGl0eSIsImNvbnRlbnRfaWQiOjEwMjQxODMwOCwiY29udGVudF90eXBlIjoiQXJ0aWNsZSIsIm1hdGNoX29yZGVyIjoxLCJ6ZF90b2tlbiI6bnVsbH0.CipVjiKAkoBXArr_shM-v50VNMnxKye3UC4DJ8ul0n8&amp;zhida_source=entity"><span>Léopoldine</span></a><span>在与新婚的丈夫泛舟之际，不幸双双落水而亡。4年后，雨果从破晓时分出发前往女儿的墓地，写下了这首诗，读来十分哀婉动人。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>《明日清晨》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>明天，破晓时分，当田野微明，我就启程。</span></p><span></span><p><span>你看，我知道你在将我等候。</span></p><span></span><p><span>越过高山，穿过森林，在远离你的世界里，我片刻也不想停留。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我默默地思索，孤独前行，外面的世界，不看也不闻。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我弯着腰，背着手，步履匆匆，满心的忧伤啊，白昼也如黑夜降临。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我不凝望那金色落日的辉煌，也不远眺驶向阿尔弗港湾的风帆，到达时，我将在你的墓旁，</span></p><span></span><p><span>放一束翠绿的冬青，和一把盛开的欧士南。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/643ce97127a8278ac76f59b3/lsuTHV5TRMTfkbXZu9mS2bDgnJs7.m4a" length="90018551" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:46</itunes:duration>
